infographic sequence-pyramid-simple
data
  title Fixing an allocation-heavy hot path
  desc Leverage order: stop allocating first, reach for GC knobs last
  sequences
    - label Tune GC knobs (GOGC) — last resort
      desc Rarely needed; only after the two below
    - label Reuse: sync.Pool, preallocated slices, strconv.Append
      desc Allocate once, recycle the buffer
    - label Don't allocate: escape-proof the path with -gcflags=-m
      desc Remove interface boxing and closure captures
theme
  palette #f59e0b #14b8a6 #6366f1
